{"number":56,"nameArabic":"الواقعة","nameTransliterated":"Al-Waqi'ah","nameTranslated":"The Inevitable","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":96,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"56:1","textAr":"إِذَا وَقَعَتِ ٱلۡوَاقِعَةُ","transliteration":"Itha waqaAAati alwaqiAAatu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"When the Occurrence occurs"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جب وہ ہونے والا واقعہ پیش آ جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"56:2","textAr":"لَيۡسَ لِوَقۡعَتِهَا كَاذِبَةٌ","transliteration":"Laysa liwaqAAatiha kathibatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"There is, at its occurrence, no denial"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تو کوئی اس کے وقوع کو جھٹلانے والا نہ ہوگا"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"56:3","textAr":"خَافِضَةٞ رَّافِعَةٌ","transliteration":"Khafidatun rafiAAatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"It will bring down [some] and raise up [others]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ تہ و بالا کر دینے والی آفت ہوگی"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"56:4","textAr":"إِذَا رُجَّتِ ٱلۡأَرۡضُ رَجّٗا","transliteration":"Itha rujjati alardu rajjan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"When the earth is shaken with convulsion"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"زمین اس وقت یکبارگی ہلا ڈالی جائے گی"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"56:5","textAr":"وَبُسَّتِ ٱلۡجِبَالُ بَسّٗا","transliteration":"Wabussati aljibalu bassan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the mountains are broken down, crumbling"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور پہاڑ اس طرح ریزہ ریزہ کر دیے جائیں گے"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"56:6","textAr":"فَكَانَتۡ هَبَآءٗ مُّنۢبَثّٗا","transliteration":"Fakanat habaan munbaththan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And become dust dispersing"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کہ پراگندہ غبار بن کر رہ جائیں گے"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"56:7","textAr":"وَكُنتُمۡ أَزۡوَٰجٗا ثَلَٰثَةٗ","transliteration":"Wakuntum azwajan thalathatan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And you become [of] three kinds"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تم لوگ اُس وقت تین گروہوں میں تقسیم ہو جاؤ گے"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"56:8","textAr":"فَأَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡمَيۡمَنَةِ مَآ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡمَيۡمَنَةِ","transliteration":"Faashabu almaymanati ma ashabu almaymanati","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then the companions of the right - what are the companions of the right"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"دائیں بازو والے، سو دائیں بازو والوں (کی خوش نصیبی) کا کیا کہنا"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"56:9","textAr":"وَأَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡمَشۡـَٔمَةِ مَآ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡمَشۡـَٔمَةِ","transliteration":"Waashabu almashamati ma ashabu almashamati","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the companions of the left - what are the companions of the left"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور بائیں بازو والے، تو بائیں بازو والوں (کی بد نصیبی کا) کا کیا ٹھکانا"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"56:10","textAr":"وَٱلسَّـٰبِقُونَ ٱلسَّـٰبِقُونَ","transliteration":"Waalssabiqoona alssabiqoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the forerunners, the forerunners"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور آگے والے تو پھر آگے وا لے ہی ہیں"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"56:11","textAr":"أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ ٱلۡمُقَرَّبُونَ","transliteration":"Olaika almuqarraboona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Those are the ones brought near [to Allah]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہی تو مقرب لوگ ہیں"}]},{"ayah":12,"verseKey":"56:12","textAr":"فِي جَنَّـٰتِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","transliteration":"Fee jannati alnnaAAeemi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"In the Gardens of Pleasure"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"نعمت بھری جنتوں میں رہیں گے"}]},{"ayah":13,"verseKey":"56:13","textAr":"ثُلَّةٞ مِّنَ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","transliteration":"Thullatun mina alawwaleena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"A [large] company of the former peoples"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اگلوں میں سے بہت ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":14,"verseKey":"56:14","textAr":"وَقَلِيلٞ مِّنَ ٱلۡأٓخِرِينَ","transliteration":"Waqaleelun mina alakhireena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And a few of the later peoples"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور پچھلوں میں سے کم"}]},{"ayah":15,"verseKey":"56:15","textAr":"عَلَىٰ سُرُرٖ مَّوۡضُونَةٖ","transliteration":"AAala sururin mawdoonatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"On thrones woven [with ornament]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"مرصع تختوں پر"}]},{"ayah":16,"verseKey":"56:16","textAr":"مُّتَّكِـِٔينَ عَلَيۡهَا مُتَقَٰبِلِينَ","transliteration":"Muttakieena AAalayha mutaqabileena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Reclining on them, facing each other"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تکیے لگا ئے آمنے سامنے بیٹھیں گے"}]},{"ayah":17,"verseKey":"56:17","textAr":"يَطُوفُ عَلَيۡهِمۡ وِلۡدَٰنٞ مُّخَلَّدُونَ","transliteration":"Yatoofu AAalayhim wildanun mukhalladoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"There will circulate among them young boys made eternal"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُن کی مجلسوں میں ابدی لڑکے شراب چشمہ جاری سے"}]},{"ayah":18,"verseKey":"56:18","textAr":"بِأَكۡوَابٖ وَأَبَارِيقَ وَكَأۡسٖ مِّن مَّعِينٖ","transliteration":"Biakwabin waabareeqa wakasin min maAAeenin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"With vessels, pitchers and a cup [of wine] from a flowing spring"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"لبریز پیالے کنٹر اور ساغر لیے دوڑتے پھرتے ہونگے"}]},{"ayah":19,"verseKey":"56:19","textAr":"لَّا يُصَدَّعُونَ عَنۡهَا وَلَا يُنزِفُونَ","transliteration":"La yusaddaAAoona AAanha wala yunzifoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No headache will they have therefrom, nor will they be intoxicated"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جسے پی کر نہ اُن کا سر چکرائے گا نہ ان کی عقل میں فتور آئے گا"}]},{"ayah":20,"verseKey":"56:20","textAr":"وَفَٰكِهَةٖ مِّمَّا يَتَخَيَّرُونَ","transliteration":"Wafakihatin mimma yatakhayyaroona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And fruit of what they select"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور وہ اُن کے سامنے طرح طرح کے لذیذ پھل پیش کریں گے جسے چاہیں چن لیں"}]},{"ayah":21,"verseKey":"56:21","textAr":"وَلَحۡمِ طَيۡرٖ مِّمَّا يَشۡتَهُونَ","transliteration":"Walahmi tayrin mimma yashtahoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the meat of fowl, from whatever they desire"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور پرندوں کے گوشت پیش کریں گے کہ جس پرندے کا چاہیں استعمال کریں"}]},{"ayah":22,"verseKey":"56:22","textAr":"وَحُورٌ عِينٞ","transliteration":"Wahoorun AAeenun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [for them are] fair women with large, [beautiful] eyes"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور ان کے لیے خوبصورت آنکھوں والی حوریں ہونگی"}]},{"ayah":23,"verseKey":"56:23","textAr":"كَأَمۡثَٰلِ ٱللُّؤۡلُوِٕ ٱلۡمَكۡنُونِ","transliteration":"Kaamthali allului almaknooni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"The likenesses of pearls well-protected"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ایسی حسین جیسے چھپا کر رکھے ہوئے موتی"}]},{"ayah":24,"verseKey":"56:24","textAr":"جَزَآءَۢ بِمَا كَانُواْ يَعۡمَلُونَ","transliteration":"Jazaan bima kanoo yaAAmaloona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"As reward for what they used to do"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ سب کچھ اُن اعمال کی جزا کے طور پر انہیں ملے گا جو وہ دنیا میں کرتے رہے تھے"}]},{"ayah":25,"verseKey":"56:25","textAr":"لَا يَسۡمَعُونَ فِيهَا لَغۡوٗا وَلَا تَأۡثِيمًا","transliteration":"La yasmaAAoona feeha laghwan wala tatheeman","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"They will not hear therein ill speech or commission of sin"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہاں وہ کوئی بیہودہ کلام یا گناہ کی بات نہ سنیں گے"}]},{"ayah":26,"verseKey":"56:26","textAr":"إِلَّا قِيلٗا سَلَٰمٗا سَلَٰمٗا","transliteration":"Illa qeelan salaman salaman","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Only a saying: \"Peace, peace"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو بات بھی ہوگی ٹھیک ٹھیک ہوگی"}]},{"ayah":27,"verseKey":"56:27","textAr":"وَأَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡيَمِينِ مَآ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡيَمِينِ","transliteration":"Waashabu alyameeni ma ashabu alyameeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"The companions of the right - what are the companions of the right"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور دائیں بازو والے، دائیں بازو والوں کی خوش نصیبی کا کیا کہنا"}]},{"ayah":28,"verseKey":"56:28","textAr":"فِي سِدۡرٖ مَّخۡضُودٖ","transliteration":"Fee sidrin makhdoodin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[They will be] among lote trees with thorns removed"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ بے خار بیریوں"}]},{"ayah":29,"verseKey":"56:29","textAr":"وَطَلۡحٖ مَّنضُودٖ","transliteration":"Watalhin mandoodin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [banana] trees layered [with fruit]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور تہ بر تہ چڑھے ہوئے کیلوں"}]},{"ayah":30,"verseKey":"56:30","textAr":"وَظِلّٖ مَّمۡدُودٖ","transliteration":"Wathillin mamdoodin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And shade extended"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور دور تک پھیلی ہوئی چھاؤں"}]},{"ayah":31,"verseKey":"56:31","textAr":"وَمَآءٖ مَّسۡكُوبٖ","transliteration":"Wamain maskoobin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And water poured out"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور ہر دم رواں پانی"}]},{"ayah":32,"verseKey":"56:32","textAr":"وَفَٰكِهَةٖ كَثِيرَةٖ","transliteration":"Wafakihatin katheeratin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And fruit, abundant [and varied]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور کبھی ختم نہ ہونے والے"}]},{"ayah":33,"verseKey":"56:33","textAr":"لَّا مَقۡطُوعَةٖ وَلَا مَمۡنُوعَةٖ","transliteration":"La maqtooAAatin wala mamnooAAatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Neither limited [to season] nor forbidden"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور بے روک ٹوک ملنے والے بکثرت پھلوں"}]},{"ayah":34,"verseKey":"56:34","textAr":"وَفُرُشٖ مَّرۡفُوعَةٍ","transliteration":"Wafurushin marfooAAatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [upon] beds raised high"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اونچی نشست گاہوں میں ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":35,"verseKey":"56:35","textAr":"إِنَّآ أَنشَأۡنَٰهُنَّ إِنشَآءٗ","transliteration":"Inna anshanahunna inshaan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, We have produced the women of Paradise in a [new] creation"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ان کی بیویوں کو ہم خاص طور پر نئے سرے سے پیدا کریں گے"}]},{"ayah":36,"verseKey":"56:36","textAr":"فَجَعَلۡنَٰهُنَّ أَبۡكَارًا","transliteration":"FajaAAalnahunna abkaran","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And made them virgins"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور انہیں با کرہ بنا دیں گے"}]},{"ayah":37,"verseKey":"56:37","textAr":"عُرُبًا أَتۡرَابٗا","transliteration":"AAuruban atraban","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Devoted [to their husbands] and of equal age"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اپنے شوہروں کی عاشق اور عمر میں ہم سن"}]},{"ayah":38,"verseKey":"56:38","textAr":"لِّأَصۡحَٰبِ ٱلۡيَمِينِ","transliteration":"Liashabi alyameeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"For the companions of the right [who are]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ کچھ دائیں بازو والوں کے لیے ہے"}]},{"ayah":39,"verseKey":"56:39","textAr":"ثُلَّةٞ مِّنَ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ","transliteration":"Thullatun mina alawwaleena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"A company of the former peoples"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ اگلوں میں سے بہت ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":40,"verseKey":"56:40","textAr":"وَثُلَّةٞ مِّنَ ٱلۡأٓخِرِينَ","transliteration":"Wathullatun mina alakhireena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And a company of the later peoples"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور پچھلوں میں سے بھی بہت"}]},{"ayah":41,"verseKey":"56:41","textAr":"وَأَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلشِّمَالِ مَآ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلشِّمَالِ","transliteration":"Waashabu alshshimali ma ashabu alshshimali","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the companions of the left - what are the companions of the left"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور بائیں بازو والے، بائیں بازو والوں کی بد نصیبی کا کیا پوچھنا"}]},{"ayah":42,"verseKey":"56:42","textAr":"فِي سَمُومٖ وَحَمِيمٖ","transliteration":"Fee samoomin wahameemin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[They will be] in scorching fire and scalding water"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ لو کی لپٹ اور کھولتے ہوئے پانی"}]},{"ayah":43,"verseKey":"56:43","textAr":"وَظِلّٖ مِّن يَحۡمُومٖ","transliteration":"Wathillin min yahmoomin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And a shade of black smoke"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور کالے دھوئیں کے سائے میں ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":44,"verseKey":"56:44","textAr":"لَّا بَارِدٖ وَلَا كَرِيمٍ","transliteration":"La baridin wala kareemin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Neither cool nor beneficial"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو نہ ٹھنڈا ہوگا نہ آرام دہ"}]},{"ayah":45,"verseKey":"56:45","textAr":"إِنَّهُمۡ كَانُواْ قَبۡلَ ذَٰلِكَ مُتۡرَفِينَ","transliteration":"Innahum kanoo qabla thalika mutrafeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed they were, before that, indulging in affluence"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ وہ لوگ ہوں گے جو اِس انجام کو پہنچنے سے پہلے خوشحال تھے"}]},{"ayah":46,"verseKey":"56:46","textAr":"وَكَانُواْ يُصِرُّونَ عَلَى ٱلۡحِنثِ ٱلۡعَظِيمِ","transliteration":"Wakanoo yusirroona AAala alhinthi alAAatheemi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And they used to persist in the great violation"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور گناہ عظیم پر اصرار کرتے تھے"}]},{"ayah":47,"verseKey":"56:47","textAr":"وَكَانُواْ يَقُولُونَ أَئِذَا مِتۡنَا وَكُنَّا تُرَابٗا وَعِظَٰمًا أَءِنَّا لَمَبۡعُوثُونَ","transliteration":"Wakanoo yaqooloona aitha mitna wakunna turaban waAAithaman ainna lamabAAoothoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And they used to say, \"When we die and become dust and bones, are we indeed to be resurrected"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کہتے تھے \"کیا جب ہم مر کر خاک ہو جائیں گے اور ہڈیوں کا پنجر رہ جائیں گے تو پھر اٹھا کھڑے کیے جائیں گے؟"}]},{"ayah":48,"verseKey":"56:48","textAr":"أَوَءَابَآؤُنَا ٱلۡأَوَّلُونَ","transliteration":"Awa abaona alawwaloona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And our forefathers [as well]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور کیا ہمارے وہ باپ دادا بھی اٹھائے جائیں گے جو پہلے گزر چکے ہیں؟"}]},{"ayah":49,"verseKey":"56:49","textAr":"قُلۡ إِنَّ ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ وَٱلۡأٓخِرِينَ","transliteration":"Qul inna alawwaleena waalakhireena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Say, [O Muhammad], \"Indeed, the former and the later peoples"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اے نبیؐ، اِن لوگوں سے کہو، یقیناً اگلے اور پچھلے سب"}]},{"ayah":50,"verseKey":"56:50","textAr":"لَمَجۡمُوعُونَ إِلَىٰ مِيقَٰتِ يَوۡمٖ مَّعۡلُومٖ","transliteration":"LamajmooAAoona ila meeqati yawmin maAAloomin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Are to be gathered together for the appointment of a known Day"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ایک دن ضرور جمع کیے جانے والے ہیں جس کا وقت مقرر کیا جا چکا ہے"}]},{"ayah":51,"verseKey":"56:51","textAr":"ثُمَّ إِنَّكُمۡ أَيُّهَا ٱلضَّآلُّونَ ٱلۡمُكَذِّبُونَ","transliteration":"Thumma innakum ayyuha alddalloona almukaththiboona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then indeed you, O those astray [who are] deniers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اے گمراہو اور جھٹلانے والو"}]},{"ayah":52,"verseKey":"56:52","textAr":"لَأٓكِلُونَ مِن شَجَرٖ مِّن زَقُّومٖ","transliteration":"Laakiloona min shajarin min zaqqoomin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Will be eating from trees of zaqqum"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تم شجر زقوم کی غذا کھانے والے ہو"}]},{"ayah":53,"verseKey":"56:53","textAr":"فَمَالِـُٔونَ مِنۡهَا ٱلۡبُطُونَ","transliteration":"Famalioona minha albutoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And filling with it your bellies"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُسی سے تم پیٹ بھرو گے"}]},{"ayah":54,"verseKey":"56:54","textAr":"فَشَٰرِبُونَ عَلَيۡهِ مِنَ ٱلۡحَمِيمِ","transliteration":"Fashariboona AAalayhi mina alhameemi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And drinking on top of it from scalding water"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اوپر سے کھولتا ہوا پانی"}]},{"ayah":55,"verseKey":"56:55","textAr":"فَشَٰرِبُونَ شُرۡبَ ٱلۡهِيمِ","transliteration":"Fashariboona shurba alheemi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And will drink as the drinking of thirsty camels"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تونس لگے ہوئے اونٹ کی طرح پیو گے"}]},{"ayah":56,"verseKey":"56:56","textAr":"هَٰذَا نُزُلُهُمۡ يَوۡمَ ٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"Hatha nuzuluhum yawma alddeeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"That is their accommodation on the Day of Recompense"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ ہے بائیں والوں کی ضیافت کا سامان روز جزا میں"}]},{"ayah":57,"verseKey":"56:57","textAr":"نَحۡنُ خَلَقۡنَٰكُمۡ فَلَوۡلَا تُصَدِّقُونَ","transliteration":"Nahnu khalaqnakum falawla tusaddiqoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"We have created you, so why do you not believe"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہم نے تمہیں پیدا کیا ہے پھر کیوں تصدیق نہیں کرتے؟"}]},{"ayah":58,"verseKey":"56:58","textAr":"أَفَرَءَيۡتُم مَّا تُمۡنُونَ","transliteration":"Afaraaytum ma tumnoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Have you seen that which you emit"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کبھی تم نے غور کیا، یہ نطفہ جو تم ڈالتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":59,"verseKey":"56:59","textAr":"ءَأَنتُمۡ تَخۡلُقُونَهُۥٓ أَمۡ نَحۡنُ ٱلۡخَٰلِقُونَ","transliteration":"Aantum takhluqoonahu am nahnu alkhaliqoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Is it you who creates it, or are We the Creator"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اس سے بچہ تم بناتے ہو یا اس کے بنانے والے ہم ہیں؟"}]},{"ayah":60,"verseKey":"56:60","textAr":"نَحۡنُ قَدَّرۡنَا بَيۡنَكُمُ ٱلۡمَوۡتَ وَمَا نَحۡنُ بِمَسۡبُوقِينَ","transliteration":"Nahnu qaddarna baynakumu almawta wama nahnu bimasbooqeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"We have decreed death among you, and We are not to be outdone"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہم نے تمہارے درمیان موت کو تقسیم کیا ہے، اور ہم اِس سے عاجز نہیں ہیں"}]},{"ayah":61,"verseKey":"56:61","textAr":"عَلَىٰٓ أَن نُّبَدِّلَ أَمۡثَٰلَكُمۡ وَنُنشِئَكُمۡ فِي مَا لَا تَعۡلَمُونَ","transliteration":"AAala an nubaddila amthalakum wanunshiakum fee ma la taAAlamoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"In that We will change your likenesses and produce you in that [form] which you do not know"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کہ تمہاری شکلیں بدل دیں اور کسی ایسی شکل میں تمہیں پیدا کر دیں جس کو تم نہیں جانتے"}]},{"ayah":62,"verseKey":"56:62","textAr":"وَلَقَدۡ عَلِمۡتُمُ ٱلنَّشۡأَةَ ٱلۡأُولَىٰ فَلَوۡلَا تَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"Walaqad AAalimtumu alnnashata aloola falawla tathakkaroona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And you have already known the first creation, so will you not remember"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اپنی پہلی پیدائش کو تو تم جانتے ہو، پھر کیوں سبق نہیں لیتے؟"}]},{"ayah":63,"verseKey":"56:63","textAr":"أَفَرَءَيۡتُم مَّا تَحۡرُثُونَ","transliteration":"Afaraaytum ma tahruthoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And have you seen that [seed] which you sow"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کبھی تم نے سوچا، یہ بیج جو تم بوتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":64,"verseKey":"56:64","textAr":"ءَأَنتُمۡ تَزۡرَعُونَهُۥٓ أَمۡ نَحۡنُ ٱلزَّـٰرِعُونَ","transliteration":"Aantum tazraAAoonahu am nahnu alzzariAAoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Is it you who makes it grow, or are We the grower"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اِن سے کھیتیاں تم اگاتے ہو یا اُن کے اگانے والے ہم ہیں؟"}]},{"ayah":65,"verseKey":"56:65","textAr":"لَوۡ نَشَآءُ لَجَعَلۡنَٰهُ حُطَٰمٗا فَظَلۡتُمۡ تَفَكَّهُونَ","transliteration":"Law nashao lajaAAalnahu hutaman fathaltum tafakkahoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"If We willed, We could make it [dry] debris, and you would remain in wonder"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہم چاہیں تو ان کھیتیوں کو بھس بنا کر رکھ دیں اور تم طرح طرح کی باتیں بناتے رہ جاؤ"}]},{"ayah":66,"verseKey":"56:66","textAr":"إِنَّا لَمُغۡرَمُونَ","transliteration":"Inna lamughramoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[Saying], \"Indeed, we are [now] in debt"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کہ ہم پر تو الٹی چٹی پڑ گئی"}]},{"ayah":67,"verseKey":"56:67","textAr":"بَلۡ نَحۡنُ مَحۡرُومُونَ","transliteration":"Bal nahnu mahroomoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Rather, we have been deprived"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"بلکہ ہمارے تو نصیب ہی پھوٹے ہوئے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":68,"verseKey":"56:68","textAr":"أَفَرَءَيۡتُمُ ٱلۡمَآءَ ٱلَّذِي تَشۡرَبُونَ","transliteration":"Afaraaytumu almaa allathee tashraboona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And have you seen the water that you drink"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کبھی تم نے آنکھیں کھول کر دیکھا، یہ پانی جو تم پیتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":69,"verseKey":"56:69","textAr":"ءَأَنتُمۡ أَنزَلۡتُمُوهُ مِنَ ٱلۡمُزۡنِ أَمۡ نَحۡنُ ٱلۡمُنزِلُونَ","transliteration":"Aantum anzaltumoohu mina almuzni am nahnu almunziloona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Is it you who brought it down from the clouds, or is it We who bring it down"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اِسے تم نے بادل سے برسایا ہے یا اِس کے برسانے والے ہم ہیں؟"}]},{"ayah":70,"verseKey":"56:70","textAr":"لَوۡ نَشَآءُ جَعَلۡنَٰهُ أُجَاجٗا فَلَوۡلَا تَشۡكُرُونَ","transliteration":"Law nashao jaAAalnahu ojajan falawla tashkuroona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"If We willed, We could make it bitter, so why are you not grateful"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہم چاہیں تو اسے سخت کھاری بنا کر رکھ دیں، پھر کیوں تم شکر گزار نہیں ہوتے؟"}]},{"ayah":71,"verseKey":"56:71","textAr":"أَفَرَءَيۡتُمُ ٱلنَّارَ ٱلَّتِي تُورُونَ","transliteration":"Afaraaytumu alnnara allatee tooroona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And have you seen the fire that you ignite"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کبھی تم نے خیال کیا، یہ آگ جو تم سلگاتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":72,"verseKey":"56:72","textAr":"ءَأَنتُمۡ أَنشَأۡتُمۡ شَجَرَتَهَآ أَمۡ نَحۡنُ ٱلۡمُنشِـُٔونَ","transliteration":"Aantum anshatum shajarataha am nahnu almunshioona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Is it you who produced its tree, or are We the producer"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اِس کا درخت تم نے پیدا کیا ہے، یا اس کے پیدا کرنے والے ہم ہیں؟"}]},{"ayah":73,"verseKey":"56:73","textAr":"نَحۡنُ جَعَلۡنَٰهَا تَذۡكِرَةٗ وَمَتَٰعٗا لِّلۡمُقۡوِينَ","transliteration":"Nahnu jaAAalnaha tathkiratan wamataAAan lilmuqweena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"We have made it a reminder and provision for the travelers"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہم نے اُس کو یاد دہانی کا ذریعہ اور حاجت مندوں کے لیے سامان زیست بنایا ہے"}]},{"ayah":74,"verseKey":"56:74","textAr":"فَسَبِّحۡ بِٱسۡمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلۡعَظِيمِ","transliteration":"Fasabbih biismi rabbika alAAatheemi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پس اے نبیؐ، اپنے رب عظیم کے نام کی تسبیح کرو"}]},{"ayah":75,"verseKey":"56:75","textAr":"۞فَلَآ أُقۡسِمُ بِمَوَٰقِعِ ٱلنُّجُومِ","transliteration":"Fala oqsimu bimawaqiAAi alnnujoomi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then I swear by the setting of the stars"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پس نہیں، میں قسم کھاتا ہوں تاروں کے مواقع کی"}]},{"ayah":76,"verseKey":"56:76","textAr":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لَقَسَمٞ لَّوۡ تَعۡلَمُونَ عَظِيمٌ","transliteration":"Wainnahu laqasamun law taAAlamoona AAatheemun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And indeed, it is an oath - if you could know - [most] great"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اگر تم سمجھو تو یہ بہت بڑی قسم ہے"}]},{"ayah":77,"verseKey":"56:77","textAr":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقُرۡءَانٞ كَرِيمٞ","transliteration":"Innahu laquranun kareemun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, it is a noble Qur'an"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کہ یہ ایک بلند پایہ قرآن ہے"}]},{"ayah":78,"verseKey":"56:78","textAr":"فِي كِتَٰبٖ مَّكۡنُونٖ","transliteration":"Fee kitabin maknoonin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"In a Register well-protected"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ایک محفوظ کتاب میں ثبت"}]},{"ayah":79,"verseKey":"56:79","textAr":"لَّا يَمَسُّهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱلۡمُطَهَّرُونَ","transliteration":"La yamassuhu illa almutahharoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"None touch it except the purified"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جسے مطہرین کے سوا کوئی چھو نہیں سکتا"}]},{"ayah":80,"verseKey":"56:80","textAr":"تَنزِيلٞ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"Tanzeelun min rabbi alAAalameena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ رب العالمین کا نازل کردہ ہے"}]},{"ayah":81,"verseKey":"56:81","textAr":"أَفَبِهَٰذَا ٱلۡحَدِيثِ أَنتُم مُّدۡهِنُونَ","transliteration":"Afabihatha alhadeethi antum mudhinoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then is it to this statement that you are indifferent"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر کیا اس کلام کے ساتھ تم بے اعتنائی برتتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":82,"verseKey":"56:82","textAr":"وَتَجۡعَلُونَ رِزۡقَكُمۡ أَنَّكُمۡ تُكَذِّبُونَ","transliteration":"WatajAAaloona rizqakum annakum tukaththiboona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And make [the thanks for] your provision that you deny [the Provider]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اِس نعمت میں اپنا حصہ تم نے یہ رکھا ہے کہ اِسے جھٹلاتے ہو؟"}]},{"ayah":83,"verseKey":"56:83","textAr":"فَلَوۡلَآ إِذَا بَلَغَتِ ٱلۡحُلۡقُومَ","transliteration":"Falawla itha balaghati alhulqooma","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then why, when the soul at death reaches the throat"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تو جب مرنے والے کی جان حلق تک پہنچ چکی ہوتی ہے"}]},{"ayah":84,"verseKey":"56:84","textAr":"وَأَنتُمۡ حِينَئِذٖ تَنظُرُونَ","transliteration":"Waantum heenaithin tanthuroona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And you are at that time looking on"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور تم آنکھوں سے دیکھ رہے ہوتے ہو کہ وہ مر رہا ہے،"}]},{"ayah":85,"verseKey":"56:85","textAr":"وَنَحۡنُ أَقۡرَبُ إِلَيۡهِ مِنكُمۡ وَلَٰكِن لَّا تُبۡصِرُونَ","transliteration":"Wanahnu aqrabu ilayhi minkum walakin la tubsiroona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And Our angels are nearer to him than you, but you do not see"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس وقت تمہاری بہ نسبت ہم اُس کے زیادہ قریب ہوتے ہیں مگر تم کو نظر نہیں آتے"}]},{"ayah":86,"verseKey":"56:86","textAr":"فَلَوۡلَآ إِن كُنتُمۡ غَيۡرَ مَدِينِينَ","transliteration":"Falawla in kuntum ghayra madeeneena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then why do you not, if you are not to be recompensed"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اب اگر تم کسی کے محکوم نہیں ہو اور اپنے اِس خیال میں سچے ہو،"}]},{"ayah":87,"verseKey":"56:87","textAr":"تَرۡجِعُونَهَآ إِن كُنتُمۡ صَٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"TarjiAAoonaha in kuntum sadiqeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Bring it back, if you should be truthful"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس وقت اُس کی نکلتی ہوئی جان کو واپس کیوں نہیں لے آتے؟"}]},{"ayah":88,"verseKey":"56:88","textAr":"فَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُقَرَّبِينَ","transliteration":"Faamma in kana mina almuqarrabeena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And if the deceased was of those brought near to Allah"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر وہ مرنے والا اگر مقربین میں سے ہو"}]},{"ayah":89,"verseKey":"56:89","textAr":"فَرَوۡحٞ وَرَيۡحَانٞ وَجَنَّتُ نَعِيمٖ","transliteration":"Farawhun warayhanun wajannatu naAAeemin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then [for him is] rest and bounty and a garden of pleasure"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تو اس کے لیے راحت اور عمدہ رزق اور نعمت بھری جنت ہے"}]},{"ayah":90,"verseKey":"56:90","textAr":"وَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنۡ أَصۡحَٰبِ ٱلۡيَمِينِ","transliteration":"Waamma in kana min ashabi alyameeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And if he was of the companions of the right"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اگر وہ اصحاب یمین میں سے ہو"}]},{"ayah":91,"verseKey":"56:91","textAr":"فَسَلَٰمٞ لَّكَ مِنۡ أَصۡحَٰبِ ٱلۡيَمِينِ","transliteration":"Fasalamun laka min ashabi alyameeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then [the angels will say], \"Peace for you; [you are] from the companions of the right"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تو اس کا استقبال یوں ہوتا ہے کہ سلام ہے تجھے، تو اصحاب الیمین میں سے ہے"}]},{"ayah":92,"verseKey":"56:92","textAr":"وَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنَ ٱلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","transliteration":"Waamma in kana mina almukaththibeena alddalleena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But if he was of the deniers [who were] astray"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اگر وہ جھٹلانے والے گمراہ لوگوں میں سے ہو"}]},{"ayah":93,"verseKey":"56:93","textAr":"فَنُزُلٞ مِّنۡ حَمِيمٖ","transliteration":"Fanuzulun min hameemin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then [for him is] accommodation of scalding water"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تو اس کی تواضع کے لیے کھولتا ہوا پانی ہے"}]},{"ayah":94,"verseKey":"56:94","textAr":"وَتَصۡلِيَةُ جَحِيمٍ","transliteration":"Watasliyatu jaheemin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And burning in Hellfire"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جہنم میں جھونکا جانا"}]},{"ayah":95,"verseKey":"56:95","textAr":"إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَهُوَ حَقُّ ٱلۡيَقِينِ","transliteration":"Inna hatha lahuwa haqqu alyaqeeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, this is the true certainty"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ سب کچھ قطعی حق ہے"}]},{"ayah":96,"verseKey":"56:96","textAr":"فَسَبِّحۡ بِٱسۡمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلۡعَظِيمِ","transliteration":"Fasabbih biismi rabbika alAAatheemi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پس اے نبیؐ، اپنے رب عظیم کے نام کی تسبیح کرو"}]}]}